msgid "RSSHub 是一个开源、简单易用、易于扩展的 RSS 生成器，可以给任何奇奇怪怪的内容生成 RSS 订阅源。RSSHub 借助于开源社区的力量快速发展中，目前已适配数百家网站的上千项内容。"
msgstr "RSSHub is an open source, simple and easy-to-use, easily extensible RSS generator that can generate RSS feeds for any strange content. RSSHub is rapidly developing with the power of the open source community and has currently adapted thousands of content from hundreds of websites."

